{"lines": ["Thirty-five minutes. One dying woman. Twenty-three hospital workers fell ill.", "Riverside, California, 1994. Gloria Ramirez, thirty-one, is rushed in with late-stage cancer.", "Nurses see an oily sheen on her skin, and smell garlic.", "Her blood tube holds yellow crystals. A nurse faints. Then a doctor.", "The room is evacuated. Ramirez dies. Five staff are hospitalized.", "And here's the strange part. The autopsy finds no outside toxin. The state blames mass hysteria.", "Livermore scientists propose a chain reaction: her pain remedy, DMSO, turning into toxic dimethyl sulfate. They never detected it.", "Oxygen and defibrillator shocks, they say, may have set it off.", "The doctor who spent two weeks in intensive care says it was real.", "So what poisoned that room? Chemistry, or fear? Tell me below."], "words": [["Thirty-five", 0.0, 0.26], ["minutes.", 0.26, 0.9], ["One", 1.32, 1.54], ["dying", 1.54, 1.84], ["woman.", 1.84, 2.18], ["Twenty-three", 2.54, 2.92], ["hospital", 2.92, 3.52], ["workers", 3.52, 3.96], ["fell", 3.96, 4.28], ["ill.", 4.28, 4.64], ["Riverside,", 5.255, 5.78], ["California,", 5.78, 6.36], ["1994.", 6.86, 7.42], ["Gloria", 8.44, 8.84], ["Ramirez,", 8.84, 9.1], ["thirty-one,", 9.1, 9.76], ["is", 9.76, 10.32], ["rushed", 10.32, 10.56], ["in", 10.56, 10.88], ["with", 10.88, 11.06], ["late-stage", 11.06, 11.58], ["cancer.", 11.58, 11.96], ["Nurses", 12.7, 13.1], ["see", 13.1, 13.32], ["an", 13.32, 13.44], ["oily", 13.44, 13.62], ["sheen", 13.62, 14.18], ["on", 14.18, 14.28], ["her", 14.28, 14.4], ["skin,", 14.4, 14.68], ["and", 14.68, 15.18], ["smell", 15.18, 15.42], ["garlic.", 15.42, 15.76], ["Her", 16.64, 16.68], ["blood", 16.68, 16.84], ["tube", 16.84, 17.12], ["holds", 17.12, 17.42], ["yellow", 17.42, 17.8], ["crystals.", 17.8, 18.22], ["A", 18.84, 18.88], ["nurse", 18.88, 19.06], ["faints.", 19.06, 19.46], ["Then", 19.86, 19.94], ["a", 19.94, 20.04], ["doctor.", 20.04, 20.26], ["The", 21.1, 21.16], ["room", 21.16, 21.36], ["is", 2